      "side": 1,
      "message": "I agree.\n\nLet me add bit more detail for you to feel better; I found that my previously theory that \u0027dtc + genrule didn\u0027t work because of current directory is source root\u0027 was wrong. I couldn\u0027t use overlay because `genrule` copies the `srcs` somewhere in `/out` and try to invoke `cmd` there. In other words, I need to explicitly specify all the includes to `srcs`.\n\nI agree that this is ugly, but was the simplest solution to also support intermediate `genrule_default` for common DT header. Let me keep this, especially because you already +2ed.",
